<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62103" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰφύσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰφῡροπώλ-ττω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαφύξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					156
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάφυξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>L.</u>
					120
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—
				Med.
			 (v. infr.), aor.
			inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαφύξασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					321
				</span></i>
			:—<i>swallow greedily, gulp down</i>, of the lion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα καὶ ἔγκατα πάντα λαφύσσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.176
				</span></i>
			; of dogs, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				27
			</span></i>; of wild beasts, eagles, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				10.316
			</span></i>, etc.; also, of bears, <i>tear open</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνυξι τὴν γαστέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					4.45
				</span></i>
			: metaph., of fire, <i>consume,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.238
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.); of disease, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>:— 
				Med.
			, of men, <i>eat gluttonously, gorge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαφύσσεται λαφυγμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					148
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
			</span></i> l.c.—Poet. Verb used in late Prose, as <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.550
			</span></i> (abs.).</div>
